{"assertion_id": "ASSERT-PZZQ-001", "classic_source": "子平真诠", "evidence_id": "PZZQ-007-001", "quotation": "八字既有用神，必有格局；有格局必有高低...其理之大綱，亦在有情無情、有力無力之間", "namespace": "PZZQ.pattern_level", "domain": "格局", "type": "CONDITION", "required_state": ["pattern_state", "pattern_success"], "required_relation": ["有情/无情", "有力/无力"], "condition_positive": "格局成立", "condition_negative": "格局不成立则不论高低", "exception": "", "assertion_text": "格局高低由有情无情有力无力决定, 非成格即贵", "runtime_action": "SUPPORT_STATE", "confidence": "A", "audit_status": "ADMITTED"}
{"assertion_id": "ASSERT-PZZQ-002", "classic_source": "子平真诠", "evidence_id": "PZZQ-007-002", "quotation": "遂分成敗；而成敗之中，又變化不測，遂有因成得敗、因敗得成之奇", "namespace": "PZZQ.pattern_success", "domain": "格局成败", "type": "CONDITION", "required_state": ["pattern_state"], "required_relation": ["因成得败/因败得成"], "condition_positive": "格成", "condition_negative": "成后带忌反败", "exception": "", "assertion_text": "格局成败可因成得败/因败得成, 非一次性判定", "runtime_action": "CHANGE_RELATION", "confidence": "A", "audit_status": "ADMITTED"}
{"assertion_id": "ASSERT-PZZQ-003", "classic_source": "子平真诠", "evidence_id": "PZZQ-007-003", "quotation": "論命惟以月令用神為主，然亦須配氣候而互參之...木逢冬水，雖透官星，亦難準貴，蓋金寒而水益凍", "namespace": "PZZQ.pattern_success", "domain": "格局成败", "type": "RELATION", "required_state": ["pattern_state", "climate_state"], "required_relation": ["月令用神+气候互参"], "condition_positive": "月令用神得时", "condition_negative": "金寒水冷冻水不生木, 纵透官不贵", "exception": "", "assertion_text": "格局须参气候, 寒暖可改格局成败(非改strength)", "runtime_action": "CHANGE_RELATION", "confidence": "A", "audit_status": "ADMITTED"}
{"assertion_id": "ASSERT-PZZQ-004", "classic_source": "子平真诠", "evidence_id": "PZZQ-007-004", "quotation": "月令既得用神，則別位亦必有相，若君之有相，輔我用神者是也...凡全局之格，賴此一字而成者，均謂之相也", "namespace": "PZZQ.xiangshen", "domain": "相神", "type": "STRUCTURE", "required_state": ["use_god_state"], "required_relation": ["辅佐用神"], "condition_positive": "有辅佐用神之字", "condition_negative": "伤用神甚于伤身", "exception": "", "assertion_text": "相神=全局赖之以成格之字, 非泛泛喜神", "runtime_action": "SUPPORT_STATE", "confidence": "A", "audit_status": "ADMITTED"}
{"assertion_id": "ASSERT-PZZQ-005", "classic_source": "子平真诠", "evidence_id": "PZZQ-007-005", "quotation": "四墓者，衝氣也...透干會支，取其清者用之，雜而不雜也", "namespace": "PZZQ.pattern", "domain": "杂气取格", "type": "CONDITION", "required_state": ["month_branch"], "required_relation": ["透干/会支"], "condition_positive": "辰戌丑未透干会支取清", "condition_negative": "不透不会则用不清", "exception": "", "assertion_text": "杂气财官以透干会支取清为格成条件", "runtime_action": "SUPPORT_STATE", "confidence": "A", "audit_status": "ADMITTED"}
{"assertion_id": "ASSERT-PZZQ-006", "classic_source": "子平真诠", "evidence_id": "PZZQ-007-006", "quotation": "辰戌丑未，最喜刑衝...此說雖俗書盛稱之，然子平先生造命，無是說也...雜氣透干會支，豈不甚美，又何勞刑衝乎", "namespace": "PZZQ.pattern", "domain": "杂气取格", "type": "LIMITATION", "required_state": ["month_branch", "transparency"], "required_relation": ["透干会支"], "condition_positive": "透干会支则美", "condition_negative": "不须刑冲; 俗书'财官入库不冲不发'子平无此说", "exception": "", "assertion_text": "驳俗: 杂气格成在透干会支, 不靠刑冲; 刑冲反使财格不清", "runtime_action": "BLOCK_RULE", "confidence": "A", "audit_status": "ADMITTED"}
